data: {"id": "f3e0d73474d94d30-thinking-parallel_evidence-1832", "run_id": "f3e0d73474d94d30", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体身份\n\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-09`\n- **Node**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.35`\n- **Pod UID**: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **创建时间**: `2026-09-07T18:55:18Z`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45` / Deployment `workload`\n- **Service**: `aiops-lab-workload` 选择该 Pod\n- **标签**: `aiops.lab/case-id=c09`\n\n**身份确认无误*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788809637956, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

